-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",48,{
[1505]="7001547F\n1\tDefeat White Hand Taskmasters (total: 5)\tWhite Hand taskmasters can be found in Fehem-dûm and Hadâd-dûm, east of Jazârgund. Borgar fears the White Hand Uruks are wresting control of the Orcs and goblins of Moria. He wants to thin their ranks.\n2\tTalk to Borgar at Jazârgund\tBorgar is at Jazârgund, west of Hadâd-dûm and Fehem-dûm. Borgar will be pleased to know that the White Hand Uruks' numbers have been greatly reduced.\n",
[1506]="7001D0D5\n1\tCollect black badges (total: 5)\tThe black badges of Dol Guldur may be found upon enemy soldiers in Gathbúrz. Rodelleth has asked you to collect the black badges of Dol Guldur in memory of the fallen.\n2\tBring black badges to Rodelleth\tRodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should bring the badges you have claimed to Rodelleth.\n",
[1507]="700394EC\n1\tTravel to Rivendell and speak with Frodo Baggins\tFrodo can be found in Rivendell, inside The Last Homely House. The birthday of Frodo and Bilbo Baggins is upon us! Frodo is looking for an adventurer to assist him with a birthday surprise for his uncle Bilbo.\n2\tSpeak to Frodo Baggins in The Last Homely House in Rivendell\tFrodo can be found in Rivendell, inside The Last Homely House. The birthday of Frodo and Bilbo Baggins is upon us! Frodo is looking for an adventurer to assist him with a birthday surprise for his uncle Bilbo.\n",
[1508]="70039535\n1\tSpeak to the child\tListen to the child's story.\n",
[1509]="70039557\n1\tSpeak to Bilbo Baggins\tTell Bilbo about Frodo's request.\n2\tTell Bilbo the stories you've collected\tTell Bilbo the stories you collected.\n3\tSpeak to Bilbo Baggins\tBilbo is delighted with your stories and would like to reward you for your time.\n",
[1510]="70039533\n1\tSpeak to Bogo Chubb\tListen to Bogo Chubb's story.\n",
[1511]="7003952F\n1\tSpeak to Dudo Chubb\tListen to Dudo Chubb's story.\n",
[1512]="700394ED\n1\tSpeak to Gaffer Gamgee in Hobbiton-Bywater\tGaffer Gamgee is located just south of the party tree and north-west of the Bywater Bridge. Frodo has asked that you collect the stories being told by the hobbits of the Shire about his uncle Bilbo. He's suggested that you speak to Gaffer Gamgee to learn which hobbits have the best stories to tell.\n",
[1513]="70039519\n1\tSpeak to the Gaffer\tSpeak to the Gaffer to obtain his list of hobbits likely to have stories worth collecting.\n2\tRead the Gaffer's Note\tRead the Gaffer's Note.\n3\tSpeak to the Gaffer\tSpeak to the Gaffer, he probably knows who you should talk to first.\n4\tListen to Ted Sandyman's story\tFollow this road from the Gaffer's out to the east and then turn south. Ted's standing just south of the Bywater Bridge. Speak to Ted Sandyman to hear the first of the stories about Bilbo and his adventures.\n5\tListen to Robin Smallburrow's story\030Listen to Dudo Chubb's story\030Listen to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins' story\030Listen to the Storyteller's tale\030Listen to Hal Hornblower's story\030Listen to Bogo Chubb's story\030Listen to Lotho Sackville-Baggins' story\030Listen to the child's story\030Listen to Hereward Loamsdown's story\030Listen to Holly Hornblower's story\030Listen to Postman Grubb's story\tListen to the remainder of the hobbits' stories.\n6\tReturn to Gaffer Gamgee\tAll the hobbits have been spoken to. You should check in with the Gaffer once more.\n",
[1514]="70039532\n1\tSpeak to Hal Hornblower\tListen to Hal Hornblower's story.\n",
[1515]="70039536\n1\tSpeak to Hereward Loamsdown\tListen to Hereward Loamsdown's story.\n",
[1516]="70039537\n1\tSpeak to Holly Hornblower\tListen to Holly Hornblower's story.\n",
[1517]="70039530\n1\tSpeak to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins\tListen to Lobelia Sackville-Baggins' story.\n",
[1518]="70039534\n1\tSpeak to Lotho Sackville-Baggins\tListen to Lotho Sackville-Baggins' story.\n",
[1519]="70039538\n1\tSpeak to Postman Grubb\tListen to Postman Grubb's story.\n",
[1520]="7003952E\n1\tSpeak to Robin Smallburrow\tListen to Shirrif Robin Smallburrow's story.\n",
[1521]="70039531\n1\tSpeak to the storyteller\tListen to the storyteller's tale.\n",
[1522]="7003952A\n1\tSpeak to Ted Sandyman\tListen to Ted Sandyman's story.\n",
[1523]="7005AAB7\n1\tCollect foul meat (total: 8)\tYou can find foul meat from ukhrâsh throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tYou should lure out the massive ukhrash from its pond north of Bárgstad.\t\n3\tTalk to Fúsi Gem-cutter\tFúsi is at Bárgstad in the Pit of Stonejaws. Now that you have collected the massive chitin, you should bring it back to Fúsi.\n",
[1524]="700190FA\n1\tBring the leathers to Hasta\030Bring Boiled Extraordinary Leather to Hasta (total: 20)\tBoiled extraordinary leathers can be processed by the foresters of Middle-earth. Hasta would like you to bring him twenty boiled extraordinary leathers.\n",
[1525]="700190FB\n1\tBring the Khazâd-steel to Hasta\030Bring Khazâd-steel to Hasta (total: 10)\tKhazâd-steel ingots can be crafted by Prospectors throughout Middle-earth. Hasta would like you to bring him five Khazâd-steel ingots.\n",
[1526]="700190F5\n1\tBring the pure fire oils to Hasta\030Collect pure fire oil for Hasta (total: 20)\tPure fire oil can be mixed by Scholars throughout Middle-earth. Hasta would like you to bring him twenty containers of fire oil.\n",
[1527]="700190F9\n1\tBring the fish to Hasta\030Bring Three-spined Sticklebacks to Hasta (total: 5)\tThree-spined Sticklebacks can be fished from the Water-works. Hasta would like you to bring him five Three-spined Sticklebacks.\n",
[1528]="700190F8\n1\tBring the items to Hasta\030Bring phials of mint sauce to Hasta (total: 10)\030Bring mashed royal taters to Hasta (total: 10)\tHasta can be found in the Rotting Cellar in the Water-works of Moria. Hasta would like you to bring him ten phials of mint sauce, and ten batches of mashed royal taters.\n",
[1529]="7003FBFD\n1\tUse worms to catch Calembel Carp (total: 3)\tCalembel Carp can be caught at Calembel to the north-east of Dol Amroth. Torchuil asked you to go to Calembel, gather some bait and catch some special fish.\n2\tTalk to Torchuil\tTorchuil is in Dol Amroth. Torchuil will be pleased to see the fish you caught.\n",
[1530]="7005977F\n1\tCollect bait\tBait can be found nearby in a chest. You should collect bait.\n2\tPlace bait in empty traps (quantity: see journal)\tEmpty traps can be found in the Wildwood. You should place bait in the empty traps.\n3\tCompleted\tPlaced bait in empty traps.\n",
[1531]="70035850\n1\tCollect promising-looking plants (total: 8)\tPlants that might be used for healing purposes can likely be found throughout the south-eastern edge of the Balewood. You should search the south-eastern Balewood for promising plants.\n2\tReturn to Ealswith\tEalswith is in Forlaw. You should return to Ealswith.\n",
[1532]="70035834\n1\tDefeat enemies in the Balewood (total: 10)\tThe forces of Isengard can be found in the Balewood. You should ride to the Balewood and defeat the enemies of Wildermore.\n2\tReturn to Ealswith\tEalswith is in Forlaw. You should return to Ealswith.\n",
[1533]="7000A8F5\n1\tDefeat Balhest\tBalhest, one of Amarthiel's mightiest Black Númenórean lieutenants, is in Ost Elendil. Legrindavor has asked you to put an end to Balhest so that Ost Elendil might be reclaimed.\n",
[1534]="700167A0\n1\tClear Balin's camp of pests\tBalin's Camp can be found west of The Deep Crossroad, north of Khurjezer, which is east of the Twenty-first Hall. You should search Balin's camp for relics of the expedition there and examine the camp's remnants thoroughly.\n2\tDefeat creatures at Balin's Camp (total: 5)\tInsects and other various enemies can be found in Balin's Camp in Nud-melek. You should clear Balin's Camp of enemy creatures.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have cleared Balin's Camp of the worst of its infestation, and can now investigate for any relics or items of interest.\n",
[1535]="7000A2A6\n1\tDefeat White Wargs (total: 8)\tWhite Wargs stalk the hills of Tyrn Fornech, but can especially be found in the vicinity of the Duskencleft, north of Ost Forod. Ballard Wilmer told you of his harrowing encounter with a Warg and has asked you to defeat some of the vicious white Wargs of Tyrn Fornech.\n2\tTalk to Ballard Wilmer\tBallard Wilmer is at the old watch-post of Ost Forod, in the hills of Tyrn Fornech, south of the Duskencleft. You have defeated many white Wargs and should now report your victory to Ballard Wilmer.\n",
[1536]="7003A478\n1\tCollect a torch\tYou should explore Madh-fushaum in search of a torch to ignite the fuel stored near the machines.\n2\tFind a torch\tYou should explore Madh-fushaum in search of a torch to ignite the fuel stored near the machines.\n3\tDestroy the fuel (total: 8)\tThere are silhouettes of many types of ballistae throughout Madh-fushaum. The fuel to ignite the missiles should be somewhere near the machines.\n4\tCompleted\tThe stock of fuel is destroyed and will reduce the effectiveness of the White Hand ballistae.\n",
})
